    {
      "id": "section:0/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Episode VII: Linear execution flow, adding `reg <- reg OP imm` ALU instructions",
      "source_hash": 16641280607672471332,
      "context_hash": 3789506150532371189,
      "translation": "에피소드 VII: 선형 실행 흐름, `reg <- reg OP imm` ALU 명령어 추가",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T12:10:02.957605Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "![](Images/FemtoRV32_design_2.jpg)",
      "source_hash": 3927734824599139,
      "context_hash": 16976629570660575191,
      "translation": "![](Images/FemtoRV32_design_2.jpg)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T12:10:02.957606Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "Let us now introduce the ALU operations that take immediate values.",
      "source_hash": 5963287479559912407,
      "context_hash": 10473866523126756816,
      "translation": "이제 즉시값(immediate value)을 받는 ALU 연산을 도입해 봅시다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T12:10:02.957606Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:2/seg:1",
      "source": "To do that, as shown in the schematic, we insert a mux before the second ALU input.",
      "source_hash": 5017249668853915930,
      "context_hash": 2085556621868251153,
      "translation": "이를 위해 회로도에 나타낸 것처럼 ALU의 두 번째 입력 앞에 mux를 삽입합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T12:10:02.957606Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:2/seg:2",
      "source": "This mux selects either the second output register from the register file or the decoded immediate value.",
      "source_hash": 14072941103045910190,
      "context_hash": 8046438360562295795,
      "translation": "이 mux는 레지스터 파일의 두 번째 출력 레지스터와 디코딩된 즉시값 중 하나를 선택합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T12:10:02.957606Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:2/seg:3",
      "source": "It is driven by an additional signal generated by the instruction decoder.",
      "source_hash": 4562095818589300963,
      "context_hash": 8530745434790964725,
      "translation": "이 mux는 명령어 디코더가 생성하는 추가 신호로 구동됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T12:10:02.957606Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "We have implemented 2 out of 7 instructions, let us continue...",
      "source_hash": 4914788792528723940,
      "context_hash": 2613539499779748624,
      "translation": "7개의 명령어 중 2개를 구현했습니다. 계속 진행합시다...",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T12:10:02.957607Z",
      "issues": []
    },
